    "historical_decision": "Act 32 of 1961 states that the Union of South Africa shall, from 31 May 1961, be a republic under the name Republic of South Africa and construes pre-Republic references to the Union/State as references to the Republic. ATLAS therefore treats 1961 as a constitutional/state-form transition within one South African polity identity, not a state extinction and replacement.",
    "designation_rule": "Preserve Union of South Africa as the temporal state-form/name for the survivor from the Union's establishment on 31 May 1910 through 30 May 1961. The Republic begins on 31 May 1961."
